If you want to start with the adverb in Romansh, you need to flip around the subject and verb, so that the verb is the second idea in the sentence. E.g. 'Mintgatant mangel jau' ---> 'Sometimes, I eat'

'En mintga cas' (anyway) comes *directly* after the first verb.

If you are using one of the negative words from this skill, you need to put 'na' before the verb.